The family is honestly Track B because critical independent sets are polynomial-time computable, as noted in the [paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/0906.4609), and the displayed matching yields a linear-time 2-SAT formulation.

The result is not yet shippable: OpenRouter rejected every oracle request with HTTP 403 `Key limit exceeded`. Consequently G9 remains pending, `all_passed` is deliberately false, and no hinted/placebo transcripts were fabricated. Once the OpenRouter quota is restored, the bare and two G9 runs can be completed.
